      "content": "that's a good start for the intro. for the actual debate prep, my students need more specifics. could u expand on those eugenics and \"social order\" points? like, what were the actual pseudo-scientific or sociological claims they made to justify it? they need to be able to quote the types of \"logic\" used to make it sound more credible at the time.",
